WEBVTT

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:07.405
An idea starts with a few words.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:09.550
Ariane gives it room to grow.

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:13.265
Write in live Markdown, and
see your thoughts take shape.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.575
Turn fragments into an outline.

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:25.905
Nest a thought.

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:31.435
Move the whole branch.

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:34.395
Open it again.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:37.865
Then stay with the writing.

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:39.310
One paragraph.

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:42.085
One sentence.

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:46.200
The page follows your pace.

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:50.735
Speak when a thought arrives
faster than your fingers.

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:54.325
Find the thread across your pages and notes.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.805
Bring a source beside the
sentence that needs it.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:04.175
See your progress, word by word.

00:01:08.050 --> 00:01:10.965
Set aside twenty-five
minutes, and keep going.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:16.525
When the idea changes,
return to an earlier draft.

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:17.715
Compare.

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:20.105
Keep what matters.

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:27.640
Ariane. Your words. In context.
